///   3. `[writable, signer]` payer
///   4. `[writable]` pool_state
///   5. `[]` amm_config
///   6. `[]` pool_authority
///   7. `[writable]` base_vault
///   8. `[writable]` quote_vault
///   9. `[writable]` raydium_signer_base_token_account
///   10. `[writable]` raydium_signer_quote_token_account
///   11. `[]` fee_wallet
///   12. `[writable]` fee_wallet_quote_token_account
///   13. `[]` raydium_program
///   14. `[]` base_token_program
///   15. `[]` quote_token_program
///   16. `[]` associated_token_program
///   17. `[]` system_program
